    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d307">

                <pb facs="0272" n="252" sameAs="frus:frus1864p3/pg252"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr.
                        Geofroy</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-11-21"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >November</hi> 21, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to your note of the 31st ultimo,
                    relative to the embarcation of such French subjects as may desire to leave the
                    insurrectionary States, I have the honor to enclose, in reply, a copy of a
                    letter of the 14th instant from the War Department, together with that of a
                    communication from Lieutenant General Grant, to whose consideration the matter
                    was submitted. Accept, sir, a renewed assurance of my high consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">L. de Geofroy,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d307-a1.xml" xpointer="d307-a1"/>
            </div>
